sequenceDiagram
 participant SDK as S3 Client
 participant GW as Rust Gateway
 participant META as Raft Metadata
 participant EC as Native Encoding
 participant NODE as 6 storage nodes
 SDK->>GW: SigV4 PUT
 GW->>META: prepare + quota + epoch
 GW->>EC: chunked/AEAD stream
 EC->>NODE: 6 shard streams / fsync
 NODE-->>EC: six signed durable receipts
 EC-->>GW: VerifiedManifest
 GW->>META: atomic commit(head/version/outbox/quota/idem)
 META-->>GW: committed read index
 GW-->>SDK: 2xx version id etag
